msgid "Natal chart wheel served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr "api.astroway.info가 반응형 iframe으로 제공하는 출생 차트 휠."

#: blocks/numerology/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Numerology (AstroWay)"
msgstr "수비학 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/numerology/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "numerology"
msgstr "수비학"

#: blocks/numerology/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "life path"
msgstr "인생 경로"

#: blocks/numerology/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "numbers"
msgstr "숫자"

#: blocks/numerology/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Numerology core numbers (Life Path, Expression, Soul Urge, Personality) "
"served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr "api.astroway.info가 반응형 iframe으로 제공하는 수비학 핵심 숫자(생명수, 표현수, 영혼수, 성격수)."

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Daily Panchang (AstroWay)"
msgstr "일일 판창 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "panchang"
msgstr "판창"

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "tithi"
msgstr "티티"

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "nakshatra"
msgstr "나크샤트라"

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Daily Panchang (tithi, nakshatra, yoga, karana, vara, rahu-kaal) for a date "
"and location, served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"날짜와 장소의 일일 판창(티티, 낙샤트라, 요가, 카라나, 바라, 라후 칼람). api.astroway.info가 반응형 iframe으로 "
"제공합니다."

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Planet of the Day (AstroWay)"
msgstr "오늘의 행성 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "planet"
msgstr "행성"

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Traditional planetary ruler of the weekday, with its glyph and themes, "
"rendered into the page."
msgstr "요일을 다스리는 전통적인 행성과 그 기호, 테마를 페이지에 표시합니다."

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Planetary Hours (AstroWay)"
msgstr "행성 시간 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "planetary hours"
msgstr "행성 시간"

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "hours"
msgstr "시간"

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The twenty-four planetary hours of a day at one place, with the current one "
"marked."
msgstr "한 장소에서 하루 24개 행성 시간과 현재 시간을 표시합니다."

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Retrograde Status (AstroWay)"
msgstr "역행 상태 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "retrograde"
msgstr "역행"

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "mercury"
msgstr "수성"

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Whether one planet is retrograde right now, and when that changes."
msgstr "한 행성이 지금 역행 중인지, 그리고 언제 바뀌는지."

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Retrograde Planets (AstroWay)"
msgstr "역행 행성 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "planets"
msgstr "행성들"

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "All eight planets that station, and what each is doing today."
msgstr "정지하는 여덟 행성 모두와 각각의 오늘 상태."

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Rising Sign (AstroWay)"
msgstr "라이징 사인 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "rising"
msgstr "상승"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "ascendant"
msgstr "상승궁"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The rising sign with its chart ruler. Needs coordinates: the ascendant is the"
" horizon at a place."
msgstr "라이징 사인과 차트 룰러. 좌표가 필요합니다. 어센던트는 특정 장소의 지평선입니다."

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Solar Return (AstroWay)"
msgstr "솔라 리턴 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "solar return"
msgstr "태양 회귀"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "birthday"
msgstr "생일"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "year ahead"
msgstr "내년"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The chart of the moment the Sun returns to its birth position in a given "
"year, drawn into the page. Without a birth date it asks the visitor. Needs a "
"site key or an API key."
msgstr ""
"지정한 해에 태양이 출생 시 위치로 돌아오는 순간의 차트를 페이지에 그립니다. 출생일이 없으면 방문자에게 묻습니다. 사이트 키 또는 API"
" 키가 필요합니다."

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Synastry Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "시너스트리 궁합 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "synastry"
msgstr "시너스트리"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "love"
msgstr "사랑"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Compatibility score and the cross-aspects behind it for two birth charts, "
"rendered into the page by api.astroway.info. No key needed."
msgstr ""
"두 출생 차트의 궁합 점수와 그 바탕이 되는 교차 애스펙트를 api.astroway.info가 페이지에 표시합니다. 키가 필요 없습니다."

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tarot Spread of the Day (AstroWay)"
msgstr "오늘의 타로 스프레드 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "spread"
msgstr "스프레드"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "celtic cross"
msgstr "켈틱 크로스"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Three cards or the Celtic Cross, drawn once a day for this site, each card "
"read in its position. A visitor can draw again."
msgstr ""
"이 사이트를 위해 하루에 한 번 뽑는 세 장 또는 켈틱 크로스. 각 카드는 자기 자리에서 읽습니다. 방문자는 다시 뽑을 수 있습니다."

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Moon Transit Timeline (AstroWay)"
msgstr "달 트랜짓 타임라인 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "transit"
msgstr "트랜짓"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "week"
msgstr "주"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The next seven days of Moon ingresses, served by api.astroway.info as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr "api.astroway.info가 반응형 iframe으로 제공하는 앞으로 7일간의 달 별자리 이동."

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Transit Sky (AstroWay)"
msgstr "트랜짓 하늘 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "sky"
msgstr "하늘"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the transiting planets' signs and degrees for a date, served by "
"api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr "api.astroway.info가 반응형 iframe으로 제공하는, 특정 날짜의 트랜짓 행성 별자리와 도수."

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Week (AstroWay)"
msgstr "주간 운세 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "weekly"
msgstr "주간"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current week, anchored to Monday, rendered into the page as"
" text."
msgstr "월요일을 기준으로 한 이번 주의 운세를 텍스트 형태로 페이지에 표시합니다."

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Year (AstroWay)"
msgstr "올해의 운세 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "yearly"
msgstr "연간"

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "The year ahead for one zodiac sign."
msgstr "한 별자리의 다가올 한 해."

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Zodiac Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "별자리 궁합 (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "How two zodiac signs read together."
msgstr "두 별자리가 함께 어떻게 읽히는지."

